    {
      "_id": "nogRWLbZV9CLjy3Q",
      "name": "Fire Form",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The elemental can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch wide without squeezing. A creature that touches the elemental or hits it with a melee attack while within 5 feet of it takes 3 ([[/damage 1d6 fire]]). In addition, the elemental can enter a hostile creature's space and stop there. The first time it enters a creature's space on a turn, that creature takes 3 ([[/damage 1d6 fire]]) and catches fire; until someone takes an action to douse the fire, the creature takes 3 ([[/damage 1d6 fire]]) at the start of each of its turns.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
